<title>USA: Washington Mutual ok with '97 eps forecasts.</title>
<headline>Washington Mutual ok with '97 eps forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington Mutual Inc chairman and chief executive officer Kerry Killinger said he was comfortable with the mid-range of current First Call and IBES estimates for 1997 which are $3.88 and $3.90 per respectively.</p>
<p>He also said he was comfortable with the upper end of current First Call and IBES consensus estimates for 1998 which are $4.74 and $4.80 a share respectively.</p>
</text>
